# Configuration is read by each service, not by this root file.
# Frontend: copy frontend/.env.example to frontend/.env.local
# Backend: copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env
# scripts/setup.ps1 performs these copies only when destinations do not exist.
# Production examples and deployment order: docs/deployment.md
# Never put an LLM_API_KEY in NEXT_PUBLIC_* or commit a real .env file.
